      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715|full_name}: No they're aren't set to paused. I doubled checked this with a separate account and I can easily reproduce it.\nThese were the steps I did.\n(Both accounts weren't added as friends (The test I did was specifically for contacts))\n1. Set own interactions to friends only on one account and other account to be everyone.\n2. On first account select the second user and set the override to force on.\n3. On second account try to interact with the first account.\n4. Nothing happens.\nHaving both accounts added as friends/setting interactions to everyone works just fine.",
